spice
* SPICE Netlist for the BJT Amplifier Circuit

* Voltage Sources
VCC 5 2 DC VCC

* Resistors
RB 6 3 RB
RC 5 2 RC
RE 3 4 RE

* Transistors (Assuming NPN BJTs)
Q1 1 6 3 QNPN
Q2 2 3 4 QNPN
Q3 5 2 3 QNPN
Q4 2 3 7 QNPN

* Diode
DL 2 3 DL

* Model Definitions
.model QNPN NPN (IS=1e-14 BF=100)
.model DL D (IS=1e-14 N=1)

* End of Netlist